WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Ryu’s jumping heavy punch reaches Elena.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.550
Standing heavy kick connects after the jump-in.

3
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.900
The gold OD spinning kick carries the juggle.

4
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.650
Ryu fires Shinku Hadoken into the airborne opponent.

5
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.250
Elena falls after the Level 1 hits.
